# API
# Origin of the backend, without the /api suffix (the HTTP client adds it).
# Must match PORT in backend/.env. The backend falls back to 5000 when PORT
# is not set, so keep both files pointing at the same number.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# The backend only accepts requests from FRONTEND_URL (CORS), and its emails
# link to FRONTEND_URL/verify/:token, /reset-password/:token, /login and
# /dashboard. In development set FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173 in
# backend/.env; vite.config.ts pins the dev server to that port.
